cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Etalon in your research or engineering work, please cite it as below."
title: "Etalon: an open-source silicon photonics design toolkit"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Romanov
    given-names: Tristan
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-23
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/romanov360/etalon"
keywords:
  - silicon photonics
  - photonic integrated circuit
  - photonic EDA
  - co-packaged optics
  - optical link budget
  - S-parameter circuit simulation
  - Monte Carlo yield analysis
abstract: >-
  Etalon provides material dispersion models, waveguide mode solvers
  (slab and effective-index method), S-parameter component models,
  netlist-level photonic circuit simulation, WDM system helpers,
  closed-form optical link budgets for AI-datacenter interconnects
  (co-packaged optics and pluggable transceivers), and Monte Carlo
  corner/yield analysis for photonic integrated circuits.
